<section id="muammo" class="page" data-page="yechim"><div class="wrap problem">
  <div><div class="stamp">Smartfon</div><h2>Maktablarning eng katta dushmani</h2></div>
  <div>
    <p>Darsda telefonlar taqiqlangan bo‘lsa ham, klassik ma’ruzalar va qog‘oz darsliklar bolalarni jalb qila olmayapti.</p>
    <p>O‘qituvchilar dars o‘tish o‘rniga intizom uchun kurashishga va daftarlarni qo‘lda tekshirishga soatlab vaqt yo‘qotmoqda.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="yechim-s" class="page" data-page="yechim"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Sinfda haqiqiy “magiya” boshlanadi</h2>
  <p class="lead">Sinf.uz oddiy sinf xonasini jonli o‘yin maydoniga aylantiradi. O‘qituvchi interaktiv doskani yoqadi va butun sinf darsga sho‘ng‘iydi. Telefonlar o‘z-o‘zidan unutiladi, chunki doskadagi voqealar smartfondan kuchliroq jozibaga ega.</p>
  <div class="steps" aria-label="Har 7 daqiqada faoliyat almashinuvi">
    <div><b>1</b>Kitob <a href="https://idum.uz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">idum.uz</a></div><div><b>2</b>Interaktiv o‘yin</div><div><b>3</b>Jonli bahs</div><div><b>4</b>Omad shousi</div>
  </div>
  <p class="note-text">Faoliyat har 7 daqiqada almashadi. Aylanadigan tasodifiy tanlov (Randomizer) har bir bolani hayajonda ushlab turadi. Diqqat 100% doskada va darslikda.</p>
  <div class="demo"><h3>Sinfning diqqati qayerda?</h3><div class="meter"><div id="mbar"></div></div><p id="mtxt">Faqat ma’ruza va qog‘oz darslik: bolalarning fikri telefonda.</p><button class="btn" id="mtog" type="button">Interaktiv doskani yoqish</button></div>
</div></section>

<section id="uyvazifa-s" class="page" data-page="uyvazifa"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Uy vazifalari: sinfda va uyda</h2>
  <p class="lead">Ikki variant: o‘qituvchi o‘z sinfiga mosini tanlaydi.</p>
  <div class="two">
    <article class="sticky a"><span class="tag">A varianti</span><h3>Sinfda interaktiv tahlil</h3><p>Bolalar uy vazifasini odatdagidek daftarga bajaradi. Telefon mutlaqo kerak emas. Keyingi darsda tizim eng ko‘p xato qilingan qiyin savollarni doskaga chiqaradi va sinf bo‘lib uni o‘yin shaklida yechadi.</p></article>
    <article class="sticky b"><span class="tag">B varianti</span><h3>Uyda aqlli avtomatika</h3><p>O‘quvchi uyda ota-onasining telefoni yoki kompyuteridan kiradi. Vazifa zerikarli test emas, 10 daqiqalik yorqin kvest. Tizim hamma narsani o‘zi tekshiradi va bahoni o‘qituvchiga yuboradi.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="demo" id="adq"></div>
  <div class="demo" id="oldq" hidden><h3>Kvestdan namuna savol</h3><p>7 × 8 = ?</p><div id="qa"><button class="chip" data-ok="0">54</button><button class="chip" data-ok="1">56</button><button class="chip" data-ok="0">64</button></div><p id="qr" aria-live="polite">Javobni tanlang.</p></div>
  <h3 class="flow">A varianti: Sinfda interaktiv tahlil</h3>
  <div class="steps s3"><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="14" y="8" width="36" height="48" rx="5" fill="#FFEBB0" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M22 22h20M22 32h20M22 42h12" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><b>1</b>Daftarga yozish</div><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="34" width="14" height="22" rx="3" fill="#D6F5EC" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="25" y="10" width="14" height="46" rx="3" fill="#FF6B4A" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="42" y="40" width="14" height="16" rx="3" fill="#D6F5EC" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/></svg><b>2</b>Eng ko‘p xato qilingan savollarni topish</div><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="8" width="54" height="36" rx="5" fill="#D6F5EC" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><text x="32" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#0E2A33" font-family="Onest,sans-serif">?</text><path d="M20 44v12M44 44v12" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><b>3</b>Doskada o‘yin shaklida yechish</div></div>
  <h3 class="flow">B varianti: Uyda aqlli avtomatika</h3>
  <div class="steps s3"><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="18" y="6" width="28" height="52" rx="7" fill="#DDF1FF" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M32 17l3.4 7 7.6 1.1-5.5 5.4 1.3 7.6L32 34.4l-6.8 3.7 1.3-7.6-5.5-5.4 7.6-1.1z" fill="#FFD66B" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="32" cy="50" r="2.5" fill="#0E2A33"/></svg><b>1</b>10 daqiqalik kvest</div><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" fill="#D6F5EC" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M20 33l8 8 16-17" stroke="#0F9D8A" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><b>2</b>Avtomatik tekshirish</div><div><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="16" width="46" height="34" rx="6" fill="#FFEBB0" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M9 20l20 16 20-16" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="50" cy="16" r="11" fill="#FF6B4A" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="3"/><text x="50" y="21" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" font-family="Onest,sans-serif">5</text></svg><b>3</b>Baho o‘qituvchiga yuboriladi</div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="page" data-page="fanlar"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Butun maktab uchun yagona raqamli yurak</h2>
  <p class="lead">Sinf.uz bitta fan emas, O‘zbekiston maktab dasturidagi barcha fanlarni to‘liq qamrab oladi. Har bir o‘qituvchi o‘z fani bo‘yicha tayyor interaktiv ssenariyga ega bo‘ladi.</p>
  <ul class="subjects"><li>Ona tili</li><li>Adabiyot</li><li>Matematika</li><li>Algebra</li><li>Geometriya</li><li>Fizika</li><li>Kimyo</li><li>Biologiya</li><li>Geografiya</li><li>O‘zbekiston tarixi</li><li>Jahon tarixi</li><li>Ingliz tili</li><li>Rus tili</li><li>Informatika</li><li>Tasviriy san’at</li><li>Musiqa</li><li>Jismoniy tarbiya</li><li>Texnologiya</li><li>va yana ko‘plab fanlar</li></ul>
  <div id="sbox" class="demo" hidden aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:22px"><h3 id="s_t"></h3><p id="s_d"></p><h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:14px">Ro‘yxatdan o‘tgan o‘qituvchilar</h3><div id="s_l"></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="emaktab-s" class="page" data-page="fanlar"><div class="wrap sync">
  <div class="five">5x<small>tezroq</small></div>
  <div>
    <h2>Emaktab (Kundalik) bilan to‘liq sinxronizatsiya</h2>
    <p>O‘qituvchi ortiqcha qog‘ozbozlik qilmaydi. Interaktiv o‘yinlar va aqlli uy vazifalaridan olingan ballar avtomatik ravishda Emaktab elektron jurnaliga o‘tadi. Bu o‘qituvchining vaqtini 5 baravargacha tejaydi.</p>
    <div class="demo" style="margin-top:22px"><label for="hrs">Haftasiga daftar tekshirishga ketadigan soat: <b id="hv">10</b></label><input id="hrs" type="range" min="2" max="20" value="10"><p id="hr" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="page" data-page="fanlar"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Kontent hech qachon eskirmaydi</h2>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:0">Vazirlik darslikni yangilasa, Sinf.uz birinchi bo‘lib kontentni yangilaydi. Sun’iy intellekt (AI) texnologiyalari va kuchli metodistlar jamoasi yordamida har yili 25-avgustga qadar barcha yangi kitoblar tizimga integratsiya qilinadi.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="page" data-page="bosh"><div class="wrap"><h2>Kim uchun?</h2><div class="who">
<div class="wc t"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="58" fill="#fff"/><rect x="32" y="74" width="56" height="40" rx="20" fill="#0F9D8A"/><circle cx="60" cy="52" r="22" fill="#F4C7A1"/><path d="M38 50a22 22 0 0 1 44 0q-22-10-44 0z" fill="#3B2A20"/><rect x="44" y="50" width="13" height="10" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="63" y="50" width="13" height="10" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M52 68q8 6 16 0" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><div><h3>O‘qituvchilar uchun</h3><ul><li>Ballar Emaktab elektron jurnaliga avtomatik o‘tadi</li><li>Vaqtni 5 baravargacha tejaydi</li><li>Har bir fan bo‘yicha tayyor interaktiv ssenariy</li></ul></div></div>
<div class="wc s"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="58" fill="#fff"/><rect x="30" y="76" width="60" height="38" rx="20" fill="#FF6B4A"/><circle cx="60" cy="54" r="21" fill="#D9A07A"/><path d="M39 52a21 21 0 0 1 42 0z" fill="#1F1A17"/><circle cx="52" cy="58" r="2.5" fill="#0E2A33"/><circle cx="68" cy="58" r="2.5" fill="#0E2A33"/><path d="M52 66q8 7 16 0" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M88 20l4 9 10 1-8 7 3 10-9-6-9 6 3-10-8-7 10-1z" fill="#FFC83D" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><h3>O‘quvchilar uchun</h3><ul><li>Doskada jonli o‘yinlar va bahslar</li><li>Omad shousi: har kim ishtirok etadi</li><li>Uy vazifasi: 10 daqiqalik yorqin kvest</li></ul></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="page" data-page="bosh"><div class="wrap"><h2>Sinf.uz bo‘limlari</h2><p class="lead">Bo‘limni tanlang va platformani birma-bir ko‘rib chiqing.</p><div class="tiles"><a class="tile t1" href="#yechim"><span class="num">01</span><span class="ico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="3" width="14" height="26" rx="3.5" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.4"/><path d="M5 5l22 22" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><h3>Muammo va yechim</h3><p>Nega smartfonlar darsga xalaqit beradi va Sinf.uz buni qanday hal qiladi.</p><span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="tile t2" href="#uyvazifa"><span class="num">02</span><span class="ico"><svg width="32" height="30" viewBox="0 0 34 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="3" width="17" height="24" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.4"/><path d="M10 10h8M10 15h8" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M21 24l7-7 2.5 2.5-7 7-3.5 1z" fill="#FFC83D" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><h3>Uy vazifalari</h3><p>Sinfda tahlil qilish yoki uyda avtomatik tekshirish: ikki variant.</p><span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="tile t3" href="#fanlar"><span class="num">03</span><span class="ico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7c4-2 8-2 12 1 4-3 8-3 12-1v18c-4-2-8-2-12 1-4-3-8-3-12-1z" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 8v18" stroke="#0F9D8A" stroke-width="2.4"/></svg></span><h3>Fanlar va Emaktab</h3><p>Barcha fanlar, elektron jurnal bilan sinxronizatsiya va yangilanadigan kontent.</p><span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="tile t4" href="#aloqa"><span class="num">04</span><span class="ico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="26" height="19" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#0E2A33" stroke-width="2.4"/><path d="M5 10l11 8 11-8" fill="none" stroke="#FF6B4A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><h3>Bog‘lanish</h3><p>Maktabingizda Sinf.uz ni sinab ko‘rish uchun yozing.</p><span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>

<section class="goal page" data-page="bosh"><div class="wrap">
  <blockquote>Biz maktab darslarini bolalar uchun jismoniy tarbiya darsi kabi intiqlik bilan kutiladigan, smartfon o‘yinlaridan ko‘ra qiziqarliroq <span class="mark">interaktiv shouga</span> aylantiramiz.</blockquote>
</div></section>

<section id="aloqa-s" class="contact page" data-page="aloqa"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Maktablarimizga yangi nafas olib kiraylik</h2>
  <p>Emaktab ekotizimi bilan hamkorlikda O‘zbekiston ta’limini birgalikda o‘zgartiramiz.</p>
  <div class="cgrid">
    <div class="demo"><h3>Maktabingizda sinab ko‘ring</h3>
      <label for="cn">Ismingiz</label><input class="in" id="cn">
      <label for="cs">Maktab va sinf</label><input class="in" id="cs" placeholder="Masalan: 9-maktab, 7-sinf">
      <label for="cm">Xabaringiz</label><textarea class="in" id="cm" rows="4" placeholder="Qaysi fan yoki sinf uchun qiziqyapsiz?"></textarea>
      <a class="btn" id="cgo" href="mailto:xumo1694@gmail.com">Xabar yuborish</a>
